        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "html": "<p>Beratung’s consistent recognition on Glassdoor's prestigious rankings highlights its standing as a premier workplace. With the top spot on Glassdoor's Best Places to Work U.S. list, Beratung has solidified its reputation as an exceptional employer. Remarkably, Beratung has maintained its place in the top four on Glassdoor's U.S. list for an impressive 15 consecutive years, a testament to its unwavering commitment to providing an outstanding working environment for its employees.</p>"
        },
